<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/msa@/~cl_23__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the procedure in relation to such appeal shall be subject to the rules of court applicable in the High Court.”. Penggantian Jadual Pertama"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/msa@> .
