<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/msa@/~cl_3__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “Land Administrator” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Majlis”, in relation to a State, means the Majlis Agama Islam, by whatever name called, established under any written law for the purpose of administering Islamic law;’;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/msa@> .
